meta {
  name: Encryption
  seq: 9
}

docs {
  `EncryptionController` - authenticated symmetric encryption round-trip.

  Run **Encrypt Message** first: it captures `encryptedMessage`, `nonce` and
  `key` into runtime variables that **Decrypt Message** then consumes, so the
  two requests chain without any copy-paste.

  The key is returned to the caller in the response, so treat this as a demo
  endpoint rather than a way to protect real secrets.
}
